  - editorLabel: "Ch1 \u2013 Find desk puzzle clue"
    hintText: There's something in your parents' room that explains what code the
      safe uses. It seems to have fell on the ground. Find it and inspect it on their
      desk.
    requiredPuzzleID: ReassemblyPuzzle
    requiredDialogueID: 
    requiredStoryFlag: 
