    gatedBehindDialogueID: 
  - editorLabel: "Ch1 \u2013 Get the key"
    hintText: There may have been a key downstairs. The safe probably needs it. The
      reassembled note gave me the numbers. I just need to put them together at the
      safe.
    requiredPuzzleID: Chapter1_parentRoomSafe
    requiredDialogueID: 
    requiredStoryFlag: 
    gatedBehindPuzzleID: ReassemblyPuzzle
    gatedBehindDialogueID: 
  - editorLabel: "Ch1 \u2013 Polaroid puzzle"
    hintText: 'The photos on your desk need to be in order: the way time flows. Youngest
      first, oldest last.'
    requiredPuzzleID: Chapter1_polaroid_timeline
    requiredDialogueID: 
    requiredStoryFlag: 
    gatedBehindPuzzleID: Chapter1_parentRoomSafe
    gatedBehindDialogueID: 
  - editorLabel: "Ch1 \u2013 All done, go to library"
    hintText: The latest polaroid showed the library. You used to go there all the
      time with Eden. Maybe you should go there now.
    requiredPuzzleID: 
